<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:24px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:700; color:#111110;">Reset your password</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#3D3D3A;">Hello <%= @resource.email %>. Someone asked for a link to change your password.</p>

<p style="margin:24px 0 28px;">
  <%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), style: "display:inline-block; background:#111110; color:#F3F3F1; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:12px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#72726D;">Didn’t ask for this? Ignore this email. Your password stays as it is until you use the link above.</p>
